# Dependency pins for modsecurity-proxy-wasm
#
# Canonical build-time values are defined in the Makefile (Renovate-managed).
# This file documents the same pins for docs/SECURITY.md, CI, and operators.
# Renovate updates this file together with Makefile via renovate.json.

# renovate: datasource=github-tags depName=emscripten-core/emsdk versioning=semver-coerced
